---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---
<BaseLayout>
  <Fragment slot="head">
  <title>Trust Center — Verification, Consent, Privacy & Methodology | AnalyzeG</title>
  <meta name="description" content="AnalyzeG Trust Center: how 5-point review screening and human moderation work, what they prove and don't prove, reviewer consent and video licensing, data access and privacy controls, research methodology, and inventory/delivery policy." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://analyzeg.co.in/trust.html" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://analyzeg.co.in/trust.html" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en-IN" href="https://analyzeg.co.in/trust.html" />
  <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://analyzeg.co.in/trust.html" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="AnalyzeG Trust Center — Verification, Consent & Methodology" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="How AnalyzeG screens reviews, obtains consent, controls data access, and handles in-stock vs custom delivery. DPA available." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://analyzeg.co.in/trust.html" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <link is:inline rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css" />
  <link is:inline rel="stylesheet" href="/css/mobile-enhancements.css" />
  <link is:inline rel="stylesheet" href="/css/aos.css" />
  </Fragment>

  <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>
  <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563EB 0%, #1e40af 100%); color: white; padding: 10px 0; text-align: center;">
    <div class="container"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem;">Platform Live Now</span></div>
  </div>
  <header class="navbar" role="banner">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="logo-container"><a href="/" class="logo"><img src="/assets/optimized/192X192_ONLYLOGO_BACKGROUNDLESS.svg" alt="AnalyzeG" width="40" height="40"><span class="logo-text">AnalyzeG</span></a></div>
      <button class="mobile-menu-btn" aria-label="Toggle navigation menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="main-nav" aria-haspopup="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
      <nav id="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation" role="navigation" aria-hidden="true">
        <ul role="menubar">
          <li role="none"><a href="/" role="menuitem">Home</a></li>
          <li role="none"><a href="features.html" role="menuitem">Platform</a></li>
          <li role="none"><a href="/for-reviewers/" role="menuitem">For Reviewers</a></li>
          <li role="none"><a href="about.html" role="menuitem">About</a></li>
          <li role="none"><a href="analyzeg-faq.html" role="menuitem">FAQ</a></li>
          <li role="none"><a href="/trust.html" class="active" role="menuitem" aria-current="page">Trust Center</a></li>
          <li role="none"><a href="https://app.analyzeg.co.in/" data-app-href="/" class="nav-cta" role="menuitem" rel="noopener"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-4"/><polyline points="10 17 15 12 10 7"/><line x1="15" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"/></svg> Launch App</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main id="main-content">
  <section class="page-header" style="padding: 140px 0 80px;">
    <div class="bg-gradient-animated"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Trust Center</h1>
      <p>Verification, consent, privacy controls, methodology, and delivery — exactly what AnalyzeG does, what it does not prove, and what you can verify yourself.</p>
      <div class="header-accent"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="background:#fff; padding:48px 0;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:900px;">
      <nav style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.5rem; margin-bottom:2rem; justify-content:center;">
        <a href="#verification" style="background:#eff6ff; border:1px solid #bfdbfe; color:#1e40af; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:9999px; font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">1. Verification</a>
        <a href="#consent" style="background:#f0fdf4; border:1px solid #bbf7d0; color:#166534; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:9999px; font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">2. Consent & Licensing</a>
        <a href="#access" style="background:#fef9ec; border:1px solid #fde68a; color:#92400e; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:9999px; font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">3. Data Access</a>
        <a href="#methodology" style="background:#f5f3ff; border:1px solid #ddd6fe; color:#6d28d9; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:9999px; font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">4. Methodology</a>
        <a href="#inventory" style="background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; color:#334155; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:9999px; font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">5. Inventory & Delivery</a>
        <a href="#samples" style="background:#fdf2f8; border:1px solid #fbcfe8; color:#9d174d; padding:6px 12px; border-radius:9999px; font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">6. Samples</a>
      </nav>

      <article id="verification" style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:1.75rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem; color:#1e293b; margin:0 0 0.6rem;">1. How Verification Works — and What It Does Not Prove</h2>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem;">Every review passes <strong>5-point screening: face-presence, device integrity, geo-consistency, content checklist, and timestamp validation</strong> plus human moderation. Checks are time-stamped and securely recorded with audit logs.</p>
        <ul style="color:#475569; font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem; padding-left:1.1rem;">
          <li><strong>Face-presence</strong> confirms a face is present in the 30-second in-hand video; it does not process biometric templates and does not prove product ownership by itself.</li>
          <li><strong>Device</strong> checks for integrity signals; <strong>geo</strong> checks consistency; <strong>content</strong> checks the checklist is followed; <strong>timestamp</strong> validates recency.</li>
          <li><strong>Human moderation</strong> reviews flagged or borderline submissions, duplicate reviewer detection, and false-content policy enforcement.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="background:#fef3c7; border-left:4px solid #f59e0b; padding:0.75rem 1rem; border-radius:6px; font-size:0.88rem; color:#92400e; margin:0;">Verification reduces risk but does not guarantee every opinion is genuine or every product claim is true. Buyers receive raw video and raw CSV to verify insights themselves. Rejection criteria include missing face, no product in hand, scripted/duplicate content, and policy violations.</p>
      </article>

      <article id="consent" style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:1.75rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem; color:#1e293b; margin:0 0 0.6rem;">2. Reviewer Consent and Video Licensing — Separate Choices</h2>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem;">Reviewers make <strong>three separate consents</strong> at submission:</p>
        <ol style="color:#475569; font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem; padding-left:1.1rem;">
          <li>Permission to submit a review for verification.</li>
          <li>Permission to sell research insights derived from the review.</li>
          <li>Optional, separate permission for the <em>relevant product's brand</em> to licence the video for advertising. Competitors receive data insights only — never video ad rights.</li>
        </ol>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0;">Licence scope, media, duration, territory, and withdrawal are governed by our Terms. Withdrawal does not affect licences already granted; future licensing stops upon verified request to <a href="mailto:grievance@analyzeg.co.in" style="color:#2563EB; text-decoration:underline;">grievance@analyzeg.co.in</a>. All licences require the reviewer has opted in.</p>
      </article>

      <article id="access" style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:1.75rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem; color:#1e293b; margin:0 0 0.6rem;">3. Data Access and Privacy Controls</h2>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem;">Buyers receive <strong>secure video access links with role-based access and licence controls</strong> plus raw CSV/Excel with video links, state/age/gender aggregates, sentiment and keyword themes.</p>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem;">Buyers do <strong>not</strong> receive reviewer phone numbers, UPI handles, addresses, or direct contact details. Demographics are provided as <strong>aggregated filters; personally identifiable details are not provided to buyers</strong>.</p>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0;">Access is controlled, time-bound, and logged. Data-handling is designed to support India’s data-protection requirements — DPA available on request.</p>
      </article>

      <article id="methodology" style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:1.75rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem; color:#1e293b; margin:0 0 0.6rem;">4. Research Methodology</h2>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem;">AnalyzeG recruits verified consumers who already own the product category. Eligibility is checked at submission; quotas are validated via 5-point screening + moderation.</p>
        <ul style="color:#475569; font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem; padding-left:1.1rem;">
          <li>Recruitment: opted-in community, no purchased lists. Incentivization is a flat transparent compensation per verification, not per rating or sentiment — we do not pay for positive reviews.</li>
          <li>Bias management: structured checklist, moderation, duplicate prevention, and raw data access for independent verification.</li>
          <li>Limitations: category and audience availability vary; we confirm feasibility before any custom collection.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0;">What buyers receive is stated in each package: video count, Power BI template, sentiment/keyword output, and raw export. Nothing is promised beyond that.</p>
      </article>

      <article id="inventory" style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:1.75rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem; color:#1e293b; margin:0 0 0.6rem;">5. Marketplace Inventory and Delivery Policy</h2>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem;"><strong>In-stock datasets:</strong> verified reviews already available in the marketplace for listed categories. Delivery is near-instant (often minutes) after purchase and payment verification.</p>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem;"><strong>Custom or quota-specific requests</strong> (new product, specific state/age/gender mix, competitor comparison with custom scope): availability and timeline are confirmed <em>before</em> purchase. No custom collection begins until you approve scope, quota, and SLA in writing.</p>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem;">SLA for in-stock: delivered in <strong>2 minutes to 24 hours</strong>. If in-stock delivery exceeds 24 hours, you receive a <strong>10% credit</strong>. For custom, the agreed SLA in your order confirmation applies.</p>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0;">Refund/credit: in-stock data is licensed upon delivery and is generally non-refundable; credits apply for SLA misses or verified data defects per our Refund & Cancellation terms.</p>
      </article>

      <article id="samples" style="background:#fff; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius:12px; padding:1.75rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem; color:#1e293b; margin:0 0 0.6rem;">6. Sample Dataset Methodology</h2>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem;">Every sample is labelled:</p>
        <ul style="color:#475569; font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem; padding-left:1.1rem;">
          <li><strong>Anonymized mock</strong> — synthetic data that shows dashboard structure (e.g., the Power BI preview on the homepage at <code>68% Positive / 22% Neutral / 10% Negative</code>).</li>
          <li><strong>Anonymized real data</strong> — when we share it, it will be explicitly marked with collection date range, category, sample size, and anonymization method.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.92rem; line-height:1.7; margin:0 0 0.75rem;">The homepage Power BI preview and the “Illustrative Dashboard Scenario” on the homepage are <strong>mock/anonymized scenarios</strong> to demonstrate how filters reveal hidden issues — not client results.</p>
        <p style="background:#eff6ff; border:1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius:8px; padding:0.75rem 1rem; font-size:0.88rem; color:#1e40af; margin:0;">Download the 5-row sample CSV with no email required: <a href="/sample-analyzeg-reviews.csv" download style="color:#1e40af; text-decoration:underline; font-weight:600;">sample-analyzeg-reviews.csv</a> — column definitions and video-link format are in the header.</p>
      </article>

      <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:2rem;">
        <p style="color:#475569; font-size:0.9rem; margin:0 0 1rem;">Questions on verification, consent, or delivery? Our research lead replies within 4 hours.</p>
        <a href="mailto:grievance@analyzeg.co.in?subject=Trust%20Center%20Question" style="background:#2563EB; color:#fff; padding:0.75rem 1.25rem; border-radius:8px; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; display:inline-flex; gap:6px;">Contact Trust &amp; Research</a>
        <a href="/sample-analyzeg-reviews.csv" download style="background:#fff; border:2px solid #2563EB; color:#2563EB; padding:0.75rem 1.25rem; border-radius:8px; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; margin-left:0.5rem;">Download Sample CSV</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
  <script is:inline src="/js/aos.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="/js/scripts.js"></script>
</BaseLayout>
